key_responsibilities:
What you will do:
- Deliver outstanding technical support via emails and video calls;
- Collaborate with internal teams to investigate and resolve customer issues efficiently;
- Represent the company by ensuring a positive customer experience throughout the issue resolution process;
- Develop strong product knowledge to provide accurate guidance and support;
- Assist customers with customized reports and analysis using data visualization tools;
- Monitor and troubleshoot connection issues using internal and external tools;
- Maintain detailed records of customer interactions, troubleshooting steps, and resolutions within the support ticketing system;
- Escalate complex technical issues to engineering teams when required to ensure timely resolution;
- Maintain deep understanding of client solutions and meetKPI.

What you need to succeed in this role:
- Excellent English skills (at least C1 for both spoken and written);
- 3-5 years of experience in customer and technical support role is a must;
- Proven knowledge of the payments ecosystem mechanisms;
- Ability to troubleshoot using databases & other technical tools;
- Excellent customer-facing skills to ensure a positive customer experience;
- Strong analytical thinking and research skills;
- Ability to identify when an escalation to the Engineering team is required;
- Positive, proactive and responsible attitude;
- Personal computer (at least 8Gb of RAM) with a stable internet connection (minimum 45 Mbps-download and 20 Mbps-upload).

Will be a great plus:
- Experience with SQL \ Postman;
- Experience with MongoDB , Tableau, Snowflake;
- QA background.

Benefits:
- Fixed schedule: Monday-Friday, 10 AM
- 6 PM GMT+3
- Opportunity to cooperate fully remotely;
- Inclusive international environment;
- Compensation in USD;
- Rewards for referring friends;
- Balance between project workload and personal time, but also -internal health policy;
- Responsive leadership interested in your development and long-lasting cooperation;
- Greenhouse conditions for self-development;
- A culture built on trust, with no time-tracking requirements.

